    {
      "source": "Any attempt to use the <code>DisabledIfCondition</code> without the presence of\n<a href=\"DisabledIf.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.test.context.junit.jupiter\"><code>@DisabledIf</code></a> will result in an <em>enabled</em>\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.junit.org/6.0.1/api/org.junit.jupiter.api/org/junit/jupiter/api/extension/ConditionEvaluationResult.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.junit.jupiter.api.extension\"><code>ConditionEvaluationResult</code></a>.",
      "translation": "任何尝试在没有存在<a href=\"DisabledIf.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.test.context.junit.jupiter\"><code>@DisabledIf</code></a>的情况下使用<code>DisabledIfCondition</code>，都将导致一个<em>enabled</em>的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.junit.org/6.0.1/api/org.junit.jupiter.api/org/junit/jupiter/api/extension/ConditionEvaluationResult.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.junit.jupiter.api.extension\"><code>ConditionEvaluationResult</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Evaluate the expression configured via the supplied annotation type on\nthe <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/AnnotatedElement.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>AnnotatedElement</code></a> for the supplied <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.junit.org/6.0.1/api/org.junit.jupiter.api/org/junit/jupiter/api/extension/ExtensionContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.junit.jupiter.api.extension\"><code>ExtensionContext</code></a>.",
      "translation": "在提供的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/AnnotatedElement.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>AnnotatedElement</code></a> 上，评估通过提供的注解类型配置的表达式，该 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.junit.org/6.0.1/api/org.junit.jupiter.api/org/junit/jupiter/api/extension/ExtensionContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.junit.jupiter.api.extension\"><code>ExtensionContext</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Containers and tests are disabled if <code>@DisabledIf</code> is present on the\ncorresponding test class or test method and the configured expression evaluates\nto <code>true</code>.",
      "translation": "如果对应的测试类或测试方法上存在 `<code>@DisabledIf</code>` 注解，且配置的表达式求值为 `<code>true</code>`，则容器和测试将被禁用。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>enabledOnTrue</code> - indicates whether the returned <code>ConditionEvaluationResult</code>\nshould be <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.junit.org/6.0.1/api/org.junit.jupiter.api/org/junit/jupiter/api/extension/ConditionEvaluationResult.html#enabled(java.lang.String)\" title=\"class or interface in org.junit.jupiter.api.extension\"><code>enabled</code></a> if the expression\nevaluates to <code>true</code>",
      "translation": "<code>enabledOnTrue</code> - 指示如果表达式求值为 <code>true</code>，则返回的 <code>ConditionEvaluationResult</code> 是否应 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.junit.org/6.0.1/api/org.junit.jupiter.api/org/junit/jupiter/api/extension/ConditionEvaluationResult.html#enabled(java.lang.String)\" title=\"class or interface in org.junit.jupiter.api.extension\"><code>enabled</code></a>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.junit.org/6.0.1/api/org.junit.jupiter.api/org/junit/jupiter/api/extension/ConditionEvaluationResult.html#enabled(java.lang.String)\" title=\"class or interface in org.junit.jupiter.api.extension\"><code>enabled</code></a> if the container\nor test should be enabled; otherwise <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.junit.org/6.0.1/api/org.junit.jupiter.api/org/junit/jupiter/api/extension/ConditionEvaluationResult.html#disabled(java.lang.String)\" title=\"class or interface in org.junit.jupiter.api.extension\"><code>disabled</code></a>",
      "translation": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.junit.org/6.0.1/api/org.junit.jupiter.api/org/junit/jupiter/api/extension/ConditionEvaluationResult.html#enabled(java.lang.String)\" title=\"class or interface in org.junit.jupiter.api.extension\"><code>enabled</code></a> 如果容器或测试应被启用；否则为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.junit.org/6.0.1/api/org.junit.jupiter.api/org/junit/jupiter/api/extension/ConditionEvaluationResult.html#disabled(java.lang.String)\" title=\"class or interface in org.junit.jupiter.api.extension\"><code>disabled</code></a>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>loadContextExtractor</code> - a function that extracts the <code>loadContext</code>\nflag from the annotation",
      "translation": "<code>loadContextExtractor</code> - 一个从注解中提取 <code>loadContext</code> 标志的函数。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>annotationType</code> - the type of annotation to process",
      "translation": "<code>annotationType</code> - 要处理的注解类型",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>expressionExtractor</code> - a function that extracts the expression from\nthe annotation",
      "translation": "<code>expressionExtractor</code> - 一个从注解中提取表达式的函数",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>reasonExtractor</code> - a function that extracts the reason from the\nannotation",
      "translation": "<code>reasonExtractor</code> - 一个从注解中提取原因的函数",
